During all this chaos, seems they were burning evidence.

335
00:21:18,760 --> 00:21:22,720
So it sounds like they were investigating us while we were investigating them?

336
00:21:23,380 --> 00:21:25,040
Man, we're a step behind already.

337
00:21:25,820 --> 00:21:28,100
The whole town got wrapped up in our fight.

338
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:29,340
I don't like it.

339
00:21:29,900 --> 00:21:33,040
Let's hope they don't resort to something even more drastic next time.

340
00:21:33,740 --> 00:21:42,840
